WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.427
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:05.510
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:09.010
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:09.324
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:11.908
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.908 --> 00:00:15.665
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:20.522
Mark the training objective complete after the self-check.

00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:25.353
Mark the inference objective complete.

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:30.292
Inspect progress after completing two objectives.

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:35.142
Complete the context and retrieval objective.

00:00:35.142 --> 00:00:40.357
Inspect the fully completed checklist and its 100% progress.

00:00:40.357 --> 00:00:45.396
Uncheck inference when you decide it still needs practice.

00:00:45.396 --> 00:00:50.086
Inspect how progress decreases after the reassessment.

00:00:50.086 --> 00:00:55.121
Reset the entire checklist for a new study session.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:01:02.480
Return to the progress indicator and verify the fresh starting state.
